WEBVTT

NOTE Transcribed from the supplied audio and cross-checked with two speech models. Closing captions stay above the disclosure.

00:00.000 --> 00:01.150 line:90% size:90%
Measure PFD.

00:01.600 --> 00:03.080 line:90% size:90%
We have to support the fire department.

00:03.180 --> 00:04.200 line:90% size:90%
Of course we do.

00:04.650 --> 00:06.700 line:90% size:90%
But we can't afford another tax.

00:07.400 --> 00:10.500 line:90% size:90%
Measure PFD costs about $304 a year

00:10.500 --> 00:11.850 line:90% size:90%
on a typical home.

00:12.040 --> 00:15.200 line:90% size:90%
More than $4,200 over 14 years.

00:15.540 --> 00:17.300 line:90% size:90%
On top of $1,700

00:17.300 --> 00:19.450 line:90% size:90%
in new local taxes since 2020.

00:19.740 --> 00:21.550 line:90% size:90%
We can stand with our firefighters

00:21.550 --> 00:23.700 line:90% size:90%
and still vote no on Measure PFD.

00:24.100 --> 00:24.850 line:15% size:90%
We're voting no.

00:25.140 --> 00:26.700 line:15% size:90%
Keep Pasadena affordable.

00:27.500 --> 00:29.400 line:15% size:90%
Vote no on Measure PFD.
